      why: '400 / (400 + 100) = 0.8. Slide inconsistency: the slide diagram makes MTBF = first failure → next failure, which includes repair time, so strictly A = MTTF/(MTTF+MTTR). On the exam use the slide formula A = MTBF/(MTBF+MTTR), reading MTBF as uptime.',
